# Advanced Browser Privacy Benchmark Feature List

## Project Goal

The user is interested in designing a web browser intended to theoretically exceed the privacy, anti-fingerprinting, isolation, and anonymity protections of Tor Browser while remaining usable for modern web applications.

This document serves as a planning and feature reference list for future discussion and development.

