# Long-Term Browser Design Goals

## Potential Browser Objectives
- Stronger anti-fingerprinting than Tor Browser
- Better usability than Tor Browser
- Strong isolation between tabs and sites
- Minimal entropy exposure
- Aggressive state partitioning
- Built-in anonymity routing support
- Hardened extension model
- Timing attack mitigation
- Modern API sandboxing
- Web compatibility without identity leakage
- Resistant to future tracking methods
- Minimal persistent identifiers